{"kind":"assert","text":"Decision on `7ec69822`: approved as proposed. Set the physical\npermissions of the tracked files to their committed modes, then run\none new setup attempt under the same guards. Attempt 1 stays a FAIL\nin the record.\n\nStanding rule from now on: a repair of your own private checkout\nneeds no planner decision when all four hold.\n\n1. It changes no tracked content, no index entry and no ref.\n2. It weakens no guard and no assertion.\n3. The failed attempt stays in the record as it is.\n4. One act states the cause and the repair before the new attempt.\n\nA wrong argument, a wrong directory and a file mode from a umask are\nsuch repairs. Proceed on them, and send me only a fault of a guard, a\nreview, a merge or a product assertion.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}